# =============================================================================
# INTENTIONALLY TRACKED — do not add these to this file.
#
# The following are reproducibility-critical and MUST be committed, even though
# many projects exclude them by reflex:
#
#   data/raw/*.log        (9.0 MB)  the two frozen corpora. The study cannot be
#                                   reproduced without them, and they are
#                                   Apache-2.0 licensed and redistributable.
#   results/              (2.7 MB)  the current final results, figures, metadata
#                                   and per-stage logs. These are the evidence
#                                   for every number in the manuscript.
#   paper/tables/*.tex              generated, but the manuscript will not
#                                   compile without them.
#   results_archive/      (1.6 MB)  the superseded run, retained as the evidence
#                                   base for the audit findings. See its
#                                   PROVENANCE.md.
#
# Total repository size is roughly 15 MB, which is well within normal limits for
# GitHub and is the price of a reproducible record.
#
# Note that `paper/*.pdf` above excludes the COMPILED MANUSCRIPT only. The
# figure PDFs live in results/figures/ and are tracked.
# =============================================================================
